@baseUrl = http://localhost:5180
@token = {{login.response.body.token}}

### Login residente (ajustar credenciales TEST)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/SGR/AuthService/GenerateToken
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "correo": "admin@local",
  "password": "Admin@Cuarta1"
}

### GET calendario — rango semanal (200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/VTS/ReservacionesArea/calendario?areaComunId=1&desde=2026-10-27T06:00:00.000Z&hasta=2026-11-03T06:00:00.000Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### GET calendario — área inválida (422)
GET {{baseUrl}}/VTS/ReservacionesArea/calendario?areaComunId=0&desde=2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z&hasta=2026-11-03T00:00:00.000Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### GET calendario — rango excesivo (422)
GET {{baseUrl}}/VTS/ReservacionesArea/calendario?areaComunId=1&desde=2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z&hasta=2026-06-01T00:00:00.000Z
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### GET calendario — sin JWT (401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/VTS/ReservacionesArea/calendario?areaComunId=1&desde=2026-10-27T00:00:00.000Z&hasta=2026-11-03T00:00:00.000Z

### POST reserva solapada — conflicto (409, regresión M-4)
POST {{baseUrl}}/VTS/ReservacionesArea
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "areaComunId": 1,
  "fechaInicio": "2026-10-28T16:00:00.000Z",
  "fechaFin": "2026-10-28T18:00:00.000Z"
}
